CM Palomar Engineers 80-6 OCF Dipole
CM Standard dimensions: 95 ft long side, 40 ft short side
CM SY variables permit independent optimization of each leg
CM
CM Coordinate system:
CM   Feedpoint at X=0
CM   Short leg extends toward -X
CM   Long leg extends toward +X
CM   Height = 35 ft
CM
CE

SY LONG_FT=97.5
SY SHORT_FT=39
SY FT=0.3048
SY HGT_FT=35
SY RAD=0.001

GW 1 81 0 0 HGT_FT*FT LONG_FT*FT 0 HGT_FT*FT RAD
GW 2 35 0 0 HGT_FT*FT -SHORT_FT*FT 0 HGT_FT*FT RAD

GE 0

GN 2 0 0 0 13 0.005

EX 0 1 1 0 1 0

FR 0 189 0 0 3 0.25

XQ 0
EN